t value for older JSON data that does not yet contain a school level. This preserves existing saved data while allowing future records to include the new academic information.\n\nAdd parser, model, storage, and command tests, and document the l/ prefix in the User Guide.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":159,"deletions":11},"docs":{"insertions":6,"deletions":3},"test-code":{"insertions":173,"deletions":9}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-11T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"96c2ac231d59ef8b4c9d33cc6854ac949ecc94a4","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #43 from spadewiz/spadewiz-add-next-lesson-command","messageBody":"Add command to schedule a student\u0027s next lesson","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}},{"hash":"34a71dd5fce221dfca203a4c5ffe19e0156caf20","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add subject to student records","messageBody":"Introduce a Subject value object and store it as part of each student record.\n\nPersist subjects in JSON and use a default value when loading existing data files that do not contain the new field. This keeps previously saved TutorTrack data usable while preparing the model for command support in a later increment.\n\nAdd model and storage tests for subject validation, equality, persistence, and legacy-data compatibility.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":107,"deletions":9},"test-code":{"insertions":93,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"75fd88919f0b9bf9aec9b4cbffb2024c2f31a877","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Support subjects in student commands","messageBody":"Allow tutors to provide an optional subject through the s/ prefix when adding or editing a student.\n\nExtend parsing and edit descriptors to validate subjects, reject repeated values, and preserve notes and next lessons when a subject is changed.\n\nAdd command-parser and descriptor coverage for valid, invalid, and repeated subject input.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":56,"deletions":7},"test-code":{"insertions":73,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"b4493cf8470565b5f4b22737c75d0a062ea6c002","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Display and document student subjects","messageBody":"Show each student\u0027s subject in the card and include it in command feedback so the academic field is visible after an add or edit.\n\nDocument the optional s/ prefix and add card-formatting coverage. This completes the subject information workflow from command input to persisted display.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":15,"deletions":0},"docs":{"insertions":6,"deletions":4},"test-code":{"insertions":6,"deletions":0}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-14T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"35a14c22e122268a065e309781925b3d120581c2","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #49 from nsriram18/feature/student-notes-v1.3","messageBody":"Reject duplicate note prefixes and verify note persistence","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-15T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"035e4674c0013df57a84ec65a8b34955c6016b9c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Change shadowjar name","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"other":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1}}},{"hash":"d865586ef3e1bdd96c0a16480983703bd5959787","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #54 from weijun72/chore/rename-release-jar","messageBody":"Change shadowjar name","tags":["v1.3"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-19T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"5eb25a9a494ba11e8e76c98ec6451d436febdbfa","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add student filter criteria predicate","messageBody":"Model optional school-level and subject criteria together with required tags.\n\nA student matches only when every supplied criterion is satisfied. This keeps\nfiltering rules independent of command parsing and provides focused coverage\nfor matching, non-matching, and empty criteria.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":61,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":74,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"d2e107e4fc953c015967f368c87c00efbef04c03","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add student filter command","messageBody":"Introduce the filter command for matching students by school level, subject,\nand required tags.\n\nReject commands without criteria and preserve the existing filtered-list\nbehaviour, so other index-based commands continue to operate on the displayed\nresults.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":118,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":150,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"12954ded1476ac68ec647bcf6eceb74557d52cbd","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Document student filtering","messageBody":"Describe filter criteria, AND-matching behaviour, and examples in the User Guide.\n\nAdd the command to the reference table so tutors can discover how to return\nto the full student list after applying a filter.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":17,"deletions":0}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-20T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"c5af7a6480c14e1dce79337e216b510f92e6679d","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Document filter command interactions","messageBody":"Add a sequence diagram that traces parsing filter criteria, constructing the student-matching predicate, and applying it through the model. This keeps the Developer Guide aligned with the filter feature.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":82,"deletions":0}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-21T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"8c7fef0b7d36dfca95f07eaa2a8c08df4c826ccd","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Simplify filter input validation","messageBody":"Combine the two invalid-input branches because both report the same usage message. This preserves the parser behaviour while making the validation easier to read and maintain.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":1,"deletions":4}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-22T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"857ff1f44b471102ad252acc58dcb3aa368d4a57","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add filter regression coverage","messageBody":"Cover blank values, invalid tags, unexpected preambles, and partial tag matches so filter validation and matching behavior do not regress.\n\nDocument repeatable manual checks for combined criteria, empty results, errors, and resetting the filtered student list.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":32,"deletions":0},"test-code":{"insertions":47,"deletions":0}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-23T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"21d1b0c1f02adb2deed09276188045af2084f6ca","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Enable assertions for Gradle runs","messageBody":"Configure the Gradle run task to enable Java assertions during local application runs. This allows internal assumptions to be checked while developing and testing TutorTrack.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"other":{"insertions":4,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"d354a487d357e08d77804df7efd792d80b33ca15","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #74 from weijun72/chore/enable-gradle-assertions","messageBody":"Enable assertions for Gradle runs","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}],"spadewiz":[{"date":"2026-09-30T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"a0e82763e881b2e41eadd87892be3e6e0c8695cb","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Update AboutUs for spadewiz","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"docs":{"insertions":2,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"74e858529a2ba0dac4d5b254ca16112375e87774","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #2 from spadewiz/update-aboutus-spadewiz","messageBody":"Update AboutUs for spadewiz","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-01T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"300209f831b59316d57188da59662d177a6e3b7a","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #29 from spadewiz/add-panneer-photo","messageBody":"Add Panneer\u0027s photo","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]},{"date":"2026-10-09T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash